.\" M4KK1 4P1 - m4k_std.7
.TH M4K_STD 7 "2026-07-22" "M4KK1 1.0" "M4KK1 Standards"
.SH NAME
m4k_std \- M4KK1 4P1 independent standard overview
.SH DESCRIPTION
M4KK1 follows the 4P1 independent standard. Core conventions:
.TP
.B Syscall ABI
int 0x4D, register arguments, return in %eax (negative = error)
.TP
.B Naming
mkrn_ (kernel), musr_ (userspace), m4k_ (syscall ABI)
.TP
.B Error handling
No errno, direct negative return values
.TP
.B Memory model
Flat 32-bit physical, no MMU/paging
.TP
.B File descriptors
Global table, up to 256
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hier (7)
